        "id": 115494,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-20T03:14:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can stack them in one action.</p><p>each one must be adjacent to another one so you could go:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>AZ - IS - IS</p><p>Then go back towards AZ</p><p>AZ - IS2 - IS</p><p>Then go back again if you have Fueled Freeze.</p><p>AZ - IS2 - IS2</p><p>You can also end up with</p><p>AZ - IS - IS2 -IS</p><p>Or several other ways.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This works insanely well to block LoS lines for Baron Blade and Omnitron's drone launching. &nbsp;When you raise a street level to height of 3 it messes with people.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:40.781Z",
